Package: pedalboard-bridge
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 jackd2,
 libjack-jackd2-0
Description: Pedalboard Bridge — JACK MIDI + audio switching service
 Rust service that bridges JACK MIDI, WebSocket, and mod-host audio
 patch switching for the pedalboard audio system.
 .
 Provides the /mode endpoint for switching between gig and studio
 modes, and handles SysEx commands from the MIDI controller.
